            <rule id="33ec-1bc2-630d-07b8" name="Blessing of the Asp" hidden="false">
              <description>Units of Skeletal Bowmen, Skeletal Light Horsemen and Chariots in an army that includes Queen Khalida may be given the Blessing of the Asp at the cost of +2 points per model. All shooting by these units count as Poisoned Attacks.</description>
